     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Hello,<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">I\r\n have made a minor update to v0.57.0 (with one &quot;major&quot; addition). <br><br>I have finally implemented the network-based statistic, via the function &quot;NBS&quot;! You will now have to install the package &quot;permute&quot; to generate a set of random permutations. I also added a function to calculate mean edge distances per vertex. For \r\nall changes, please see the &quot;NEWS.md&quot; \r\nfile (highlighted in green) at <a href=\"https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/ec1ee8500601fd7e856dbb9b19ee01dd3de09bf5?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/ec1ee8500601fd7e856dbb9b19ee01dd3de09bf5?short_path%3D8312ad0%23diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488268386000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kDqstfaIWrwgOX7ql9mJx\">the Github diff page</a>.<br><br>The User Guide has been updated as well.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Happy New Year!<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Chris<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><div><div><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/x7Az90uC0FlqG1NQNJvbQl7YtYRlnWzoqu2O_ZLb9xIKhYpJarh3aZrZ_qlU6_VKMQpRwI5_nDi9FsJOqf0XSQHw_6yv1VK7rhIBScGS2g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ssl.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/images/cleardot.gif\"></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
